1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
1.1 Introduction

The objective of this project is to design and develop a premium, visually sophisticated, multi-brand makeup catalogue website that allows users to discover, explore, browse and compare makeup products from leading international beauty brands.

The website should combine the elegance of luxury beauty brands with the functionality of a modern cosmetics catalogue.

The platform will be inspired by the design languages, product presentation techniques, navigation systems, visual storytelling and product categorisation of the following seven websites:

CHANEL — https://www.chanel.com/in/
KIKO MILANO — https://us.kikocosmetics.com/collections/face-makeup
Charlotte Tilbury — https://www.charlottetilbury.com/us/products/makeup
Fenty Beauty — https://fentybeauty.com/en-in
Kylie Cosmetics — https://kyliecosmetics.com/en-in
Dior Beauty — https://www.dior.com/en_hk/beauty
TOM FORD Beauty — https://www.tomfordbeauty.com/collections/makeup

The website must not directly copy any reference website. Instead, it should combine the strongest design principles of all seven brands into a distinctive and consistent visual identity.

1.2 Product Vision

Create a digital luxury beauty destination that feels like a combination of:

A luxury beauty magazine.
A premium makeup catalogue.
A multi-brand cosmetics discovery platform.
An editorial beauty experience.
A modern product research and comparison platform.

The website should allow customers to discover products by brand, category, shade, colour, finish and price.

The main objective is to make makeup discovery visually engaging, convenient, organised and enjoyable.

1.3 Core Product Philosophy

The website must follow three fundamental principles:

Luxury: Every page should look premium, sophisticated and professionally designed.

Discovery: Users should be able to explore makeup products and brands without difficulty.

Trust: All displayed product names, images, descriptions, shades and prices should be accurate and verifiable.

